metadata.description:
{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 Courier;}}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The bridge script for TwelveTake REAPER MCP. It runs inside REAPER and carries out requests from the TwelveTake REAPER MCP server, so an AI app that supports MCP, such as Claude Desktop, Codex or Gemini CLI, can work on the project you have open.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Run it from the action list: type {\f1 mcp bridge} in the filter box, select the script and click Run. REAPER's console confirms it has started. To have REAPER start it every time it launches, run {\f1 uvx twelvetake-reaper-mcp --autostart} in a terminal.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaPack installs the bridge and the TwelveTake MCP Analyzer, a small JSFX plugin that the measurement tools use. You add the MCP server to your AI app separately. The setup steps are at https://twelvetake.com/tools/reaper-mcp/#setup\par}
}

